<title>UK: DePfa sets 100 mln mark step-up callable bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 100 mln mark step-up callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following pfandbrief was</p>
<p>announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY   *19.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.40    PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO JUNE 1997 WHEN THE DEAL IS CALLABLE AT PAR, AND</p>
<p>		4.75 PERCENT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  1.40 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
